m/apps/3300580/extras/eb88514e088e096d02580a7db37835dd.poster.avif?t=1735199216\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300580/extras/eb88514e088e096d02580a7db37835dd.webm?t=1735199216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300580/extras/eb88514e088e096d02580a7db37835dd.mp4?t=1735199216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guidelines for Content Sharing and Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find the guidelines for video streaming and content sharing on the USAYA website.</p>",
